	<section_number>2.2-4353</section_number>
	<catch_line>Date of postmark deemed to be date payment is made</catch_line>
	<text>
		In those cases where payment is made by mail, the date of postmark shall be deemed to be the date payment is made for purposes of this chapter.
	</text>
	<history>1984, c. 736, § 11-62.6; 2001, c. 844.</history>
</law>
